<title>SINGAPORE: BADMINTON-SINGAPORE OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-SINGAPORE OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the finals in the</p>
<p>Konica Cup Singapore international badminton championships on</p>
<p>Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>2-Heryanto Arbi (Indonesia) beat 5-Indra Wijaya (Indonesia)</p>
<p>3-15 18-14 15-9</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>2-Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat 1-Gong Zhichao (China) 11-12</p>
<p>11-8 11-4</p>
</text>
